title 25 - Wetlands: harbor, raptors and coast
faction Alliance
race NightElf
class Druid
levels 24-28
zone Wetlands
category Leveling
folder Aurum - Druid and dungeons
version 2
next aurum-druid/excavation-site

# Original Aurum route text. Factual quest/objective cross-checks: current
# Forever data; Polestar 06/07/30-40-01 (GPL-3.0-only); local RXP Wetlands
# reference with Druid-compatible conditions. No copied private guide text.
# This explicit quest circuit replaces the former large pre-dungeon grind.

step Menethil: outdoor supplies and errands
  tip From Svens Camp, return by the road to the nearest learned Alliance flight master at Sentinel Hill, then fly to Menethil. This visit combines outdoor XP with the upcoming Excavation Site trip. Young Crocolisk Skins was completed during Cat Form preparation. The Greenwarden combat is deliberately saved for this visit. Learn the flight path if it was missed and keep the southern dungeon pickups in your log.
  fly "Menethil Harbor"
  getfp "Menethil Harbor" npc 1571
  sethome "Deepwater Tavern" npc 1464
  vendor 1450 -- Repair at Brahnmar before buying drinks at the inn.
  vendor 1464 -- Keep 10-20 usable drinks, adjusting the amount to your remaining money and supplies.
  accept 463
  accept 98230 lvl 22
  accept 288 lvl 22
  buy 2594 x1 npc 1464 -- One Flagon of Mead for Fitzsimmons, not a drink supply stack.
  turnin 288
  accept 289 lvl 22
  accept 526 lvl 20 -- Glorin Steelbrow is upstairs in the tavern; use the staircase.
  accept 279 lvl 20
  accept 471 lvl 18
  accept 470 lvl 19
  accept 305 lvl 21
  accept 98282 lvl 20
  accept 98197 lvl 18
  accept 464 lvl 23
  accept 98208 -- Sylessa Duskwhisper is upstairs in the inn.

step Harbor materials
  tip Gather timber and iron from the piles around Menethil's keep and walls, then deliver them before the coastal loop. These are ground containers in town, not a mining requirement.
  collect 279821 quest 98197.1
  collect 279822 quest 98197.2
  turnin 98197

step Bluegill Marsh
  tip Leave the harbor north along the coast. Kill the ordinary Bluegill murlocs and isolate Gobbler from his companions. Return to Karl on the pier immediately afterward to unlock the nearby container trail.
  kill 1024 quest 279.1
  collect 3618 npc 1259 quest 279.2
  turnin 279
  accept 281 lvl 20

step Follow the missing cargo
  tip Return to the murloc hovels and open the three containers in order from south to north. The containers themselves offer the next clue; take each follow-up before leaving its hovel.
  turnin 281 @13.5,41.4 era -- Damaged Crate.
  accept 284 lvl 20
  turnin 284 @13.6,38.2 era -- Sealed Barrel.
  accept 285 lvl 20
  turnin 285 @13.9,34.8 era -- Half-buried Barrel.
  accept 286 lvl 20

step Coastal crocolisks before the eastward trip
  tip Collect the giant crocolisk skins from the coast north of the murloc hovels, then return to Menethil. Leave the ship crews, Snellig and Captain Halyndor for after the eastern outdoor circuit: they are much stronger than these early coastal targets.
  collect 3348 npc 2089 quest 471.1 @17.61,29.11 era

step Menethil: statuette and skin hand-ins
  tip Return the statuette to Karl and Stoutfist upstairs in the keep, then deliver the giant crocolisk skins to James. Take the scale task for the eastward trip; the wreck quests remain scheduled for later in this chapter.
  turnin 286
  accept 98189
  turnin 98189 -- Deliver Karl Borans statuette to Stoutfist upstairs in the keep.
  accept 98190 -- Hold the family introduction for our planned Stormwind Keep visit.
  turnin 471
  accept 98072 -- Follow-up after Apprentices Duties; save this for the eastern whelps.
  vendor 1450
  vendor 1464

step Dragonmaw banners
  tip On the eastward road, clear the ordinary Dragonmaw Raiders at the western Angerfang camp. They can net you; pull into ground already cleared. Do not enter Nekroshs camp or accept the elite follow-up.
  collect 3337 npc 1034 quest 464.1 @42.16,44.58 era

step Whelgar's outdoor excavation
  tip Follow the road east to Whelgar's outdoor dig. Enter from the north, climb the eastern path and cross the wooden bridge to the small cave. Speak to Merrin, Ormer and Whelgar. This is the outdoor excavation, not the dungeon portal.
  turnin 305
  accept 306 lvl 21
  accept 294 lvl 22
  accept 299 lvl 22

step Lower raptor clear and relics
  tip Kill the ordinary Mottled Raptors and Screechers around the dig. While clearing, open the relic containers and check loose soil for the four fragments. Keep the Ormer chain moving by returning to him after the first pair of kill objectives.
  kill 1020 quest 294.1
  kill 1021 quest 294.2
  collect 2658 quest 299.1
  collect 2659 quest 299.2
  collect 2660 quest 299.3
  collect 2661 quest 299.4
  turnin 294
  accept 295 lvl 22
  turnin 299

step The stronger raptors
  tip Clear Scytheclaws and Mottled Razormaws on the valley slopes west of the dig. These are Ormer's ordinary raptors; the larger Highland and Razormaw populations farther north belong to other quests.
  kill 1022 quest 295.1
  kill 1023 quest 295.2
  turnin 295
  accept 296 lvl 22

step Thelgen spiders
  tip Continue east and south toward Thelgen Rock. The gland comes from Cave Stalkers and Leech Stalkers around this area; clear the outside spiders first and stop after obtaining one intact gland. Do not clear the whole cave merely for this item.
  collect 280319 npc 1111 quest 98282.1 @53.01,65.36 era

step Greenwarden: Mosshide prerequisite chain
  tip Deliver the introduction to Rethiel and complete his two nearby Mosshide tasks. This chain unlocks Horrors in the Highland for Excavation Site. The higher-level marsh enemies were intentionally deferred from the level-20 Cat Form trip.
  turnin 463
  accept 276
  complete 276
  turnin 276
  accept 277
  complete 277
  turnin 277
  accept 275

step Greenwarden: Fen Creepers
  tip Fen Creepers are level 24-25 and hide along the streams. Clear them while working the surrounding marsh now, then report to Rethiel before the dungeon chapter. Avoid attacking higher-level bog beasts just because they share the area.
  kill 1040 quest 275.1 @55.03,46.43 era
  turnin 275

step Red whelps along the eastward route
  tip Collect the crimson scales from ordinary Red Whelps on the eastern marsh. These level-23 whelps are preferable to stronger remote variants; skin them as you go. The delivery follow-up returns to Howin, whom we will visit before the dungeon.
  collect 279385 npc 1042 quest 98072.1 @59.60,44.11 era
  accept 469 lvl 18 -- Einar Stonegrip is by the road on the way to Howin; carry his skins to Menethil.

step Green Belt and northern raptors
  tip Follow the road north-east to Howin Kindfeather and deliver Stoutfist's message. Take both outdoor raptor tasks before heading north. The elite Carnage, Dragonmaw Gates and Goaz guardian chains are not required in this solo circuit.
  turnin 98230
  accept 98245 lvl 21
  accept 98246 lvl 21

step Razormaw nesting grounds
  tip Follow the path into Raptor Ridge, whose cave mouth is at the marked entrance. Gather incisors from Highland and Elder Razormaws and eggs from their nests. This is a short nest clear with no escort or elite boss; pull into cleared space and retreat if respawns close the exit. Do not run through occupied nests.
  goto 69.43,34.67 "Raptor Ridge cave entrance" live r 20

step Raptor Ridge nests
  tip Continue from the entrance into the nesting chambers. Clear toward the eggs with a safe retreat path; leave after both counters are complete.
  collect 280103 quest 98245.1 @67.44,30.76 live
  collect 280132 quest 98246.1 @67.44,30.76 live -- Nests along the verified Raptor Ridge loop; check the current quest-log counter before leaving.
  turnin 98245
  turnin 98246

step Sida's bag on the western return
  tip Clear Black Oozes on the marsh route back toward Menethil until Sida's bag drops. Use the western spawn group so this return does not send you to a remote northern pool.
  collect 3349 npc 1032 quest 470.1 @28.25,45.7 era

step Wrecks after the eastern circuit
  tip After the eastern circuit, go north along the coast to the Third Fleet wrecks. Snellig is level 29; the earlier tasks give time to reach the appropriate level before this fight. Clear the beach sailors before boarding for the marines; Snellig stands near the southern wreck. Keep away from large groups on the decks and watch your breath underwater.
  kill 1157 quest 289.1
  kill 1158 quest 289.2
  collect 3619 npc 1159 quest 289.3
  collect 2702 npc 1418 quest 526.1 @19.17,19.51 era -- Bluegill Raiders on the north coast, not the distant Arathi shore.

step Menethil: the completed wreck tasks
  tip Deliver the crews task and the ingots, then take the captain follow-up before returning to the wreck. Glorin is upstairs in the inn. Repair and refill drinks before fighting the captain.
  turnin 289
  accept 290 lvl 22
  turnin 526
  vendor 1450
  vendor 1464

step Captain and the locked strongbox
  tip Return to the northern wreck. Captain Halyndor is level 30 on deck; clear the approach, pull him alone and take the key. His Ward of the Eye reflects spells: stop casting damage into that buff. The locked strongbox is below deck in the hold: descend inside the ship after looting the captain, then accept the Eye of Paleth from the chest.
  collect 2629 npc 1160 quest 290.1
  turnin 290
  accept 292 lvl 22

step Menethil: finish the coastal story
  tip Hand the Eye to Glorin upstairs. Keep Cleansing the Eye for the planned Stormwind Cathedral visit later, alongside Seeking Wisdom; no separate city trip is required.
  turnin 292
  accept 293 lvl 22

step Southern wreck: recover Nordel
  tip On the return to Menethil, recover Nordel from the shipwreck just south of town. Check the wreckage before returning to Sylessa upstairs in the inn. The Darkshore delivery follow-up is not part of this southern route.
  collect 279915 quest 98208.1 @12.10,64.03 live

step Menethil: complete the outdoor circuit
  tip Return along the road to the harbor and deliver the expedition message, gland and bag. Use your hearth if it is ready and still bound here; do not wait out a cooldown. The following chapter starts the Excavation Site group trip from this same town.
  turnin 306
  turnin 98282
  turnin 470
  turnin 469
  turnin 464
  turnin 98208
  turnin 98072
  accept 98240 lvl 19 -- Hold the crimson crate for Howin on the dungeon approach already planned next.
  vendor 1450
  vendor 1464
  level 26 -- Dungeon readiness check after the explicit outdoor quest circuit. The Planner audit reports any remaining XP shortfall separately; no uncounted dungeon runs are assumed.
